Tenali Rama and the Wise Judge (Raw Story)

One day, two women came to King Krishnadevaraya with a baby.

Both of them claimed that the baby belonged to them.

The king was confused and could not decide who was telling the truth.

He asked Tenali Rama to help solve the problem.

Tenali thought for a moment and said, “Bring a sword.”

Everyone in the court was shocked.

Tenali said, “We will cut the baby into two and give each woman one half.”

One woman agreed immediately.

But the other woman began to cry and said, “No! Please do not harm the baby. Let her take the child.”

Tenali smiled and said, “Your Majesty, this woman is the real mother.”

The king asked, “How do you know?”

Tenali replied, “A true mother would never want her child to be hurt.”

The king agreed and gave the baby to the real mother.

The other woman was punished for lying.

💖 Moral:

True love is selfless.
